24c600c4 [deepseek-v4-flash] #A few observations from the output:
24c600c4 [deepseek-v4-flash] #
24c600c4 [deepseek-v4-flash] #- The physical sector order varies per track (e.g. track 0 starts at sector 2, track 1 at sector 0,
24c600c4 [deepseek-v4-flash] #track 2 at sector 10). That's normal — DOS 3.3 uses different skew/interleave patterns per track,
24c600c5 [deepseek-v4-flash] #so don't try to impose a fixed order. Just store each sector by its decoded number.
24c600c5 [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Track 34 doesn't appear in the logs. It may be unformatted, intentionally empty, or using
24c600c5 [deepseek-v4-flash] #non-standard markers. Worth checking separately if the game needs it.
