24eb6bd7 [claude-haiku-4-5] #• VIC-II addresses that could be used* (not currently leveraged):
24eb6bd7 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- $D012 (raster line) - already read for timing, could use for blink sync
24eb6bd7 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- $D011 (control register) - has display enable but not cursor-specific
