24eb72ec [claude-haiku-4-5] #2. Actual C64 timing:
24eb72ec [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - CPU clock: ~985kHz (PAL)
24eb72ed [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Raster lines: 312 per frame @ 50Hz
24eb72ed [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Cycles per line: ~63 cycles
24eb72ed [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Raster interrupt every ~63 cycles (per line), not every `333/12=27.75` cycles
