25051899 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- `MIM_OPEN` — device opened
25051899 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- `MIM_CLOSE` — device closed
2505189a [claude-haiku-4-5] #- `MIM_ERROR` — invalid MIDI data
2505189a [claude-haiku-4-5] #- `MIM_LONGDATA` — system exclusive (sysex) messages
2505189a [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2505189a [claude-haiku-4-5] #Without the check, you'd process all callback invocations, including device lifecycle events that
