2511a73a [claude-haiku-4-5] #Good approach. Before refactoring, enumerate the surface. Here's a testing strategy:
2511a73a [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a73a [claude-haiku-4-5] #• Setup*: Create test cases across all major command paths. Document pass/fail +
2511a73b [claude-haiku-4-5] #observations.
2511a73b [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a73b [claude-haiku-4-5] #• Test categories:*
2511a73b [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a73c [claude-haiku-4-5] #1. File operations (`/share`, `/drop`, `/push`, `/commit`)
2511a73c [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Single file, multiple files, glob patterns
2511a73c [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Recursive globs (`.md`, `/.md`)
2511a73c [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Invalid paths, special characters in names
2511a73d [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Large files, deeply nested trees
2511a73d [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a73d [claude-haiku-4-5] #2. Project management (`/project`, `/cd`, `/dir`)
2511a73d [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Create new project via `/share relay/*.md`
2511a73e [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Switch projects, verify state restoration
2511a73e [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Project name collisions
2511a73e [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Drop project, reload project
2511a73e [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a73e [claude-haiku-4-5] #3. Configuration (`/config`)
2511a73f [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Toggle each of 25 flags, verify behavior
2511a73f [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Persistence across sessions
2511a73f [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Interactions between flags (e.g., `budget` + `logging`)
2511a73f [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a740 [claude-haiku-4-5] #4. Model switching (`/model`, `/dump`, `/account`)
2511a740 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Cycle through all providers (OpenAI, DeepSeek, Anthropic, xAI, Google)
2511a740 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Check rate limits, balance display
2511a740 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Tool calls with different models
2511a741 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a741 [claude-haiku-4-5] #5. History (`/history`, `/reset`, `/save`, `/load`)
2511a741 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Long conversations (1000+ messages)
2511a741 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Squashing behavior with tool results
2511a742 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Reset confirmation (does it prompt?)
2511a742 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
2511a742 [claude-haiku-4-5] #6. Edge cases
2511a742 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Empty directory shares
2511a743 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Symlinks, junctions
2511a743 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Unicode filenames
2511a743 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Concurrent connections (if `/listen` is on)
2511a743 [claude-haiku-4-5] #   - Input with shell metacharacters (`>`, `|`, `&`, etc.)
