25191231 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
25191231 [claude-haiku-4-5] #Yes, exactly. The TED (Plus/4) has ROM/RAM overlay at C000-FFFF. When RAM is banked in,
25191231 [claude-haiku-4-5] #writes should go to RAM even if ROM normally occupies that space.
