25192b83 [claude-haiku-4-5] #This is a comprehensive 6502 emulator with support for multiple vintage computer platforms (Apple
25192b83 [claude-haiku-4-5] #II, C64, Vic-20, Plus/4, Atari, 1541 drive). I'll highlight key observations:
