25192b84 [claude-haiku-4-5] #1. Extensive opcode coverage - Nearly complete 6502 instruction set implemented
25192b84 [claude-haiku-4-5] #2. Multi-platform architecture - Clean dispatch for Apple, Commodore, Atari systems
25192b85 [claude-haiku-4-5] #3. I/O handling - Good separation of concerns for device-specific reads/writes
25192b85 [claude-haiku-4-5] #4. Audio/cassette simulation - CassetteRecorder class with WAV file support is
25192b85 [claude-haiku-4-5] #well-designed
25192b85 [claude-haiku-4-5] #5. Display rendering - Multiple rendering modes (text, graphics, hires, wide characters)
