253c3b7e [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Index 5: `39` - Absolute,Y
253c3b7e [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Index 6: `21` - (Indirect,X)
253c3b7e [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Index 7: `31` - (Indirect),Y
253c3b7f [claude-haiku-4-5] #
253c3b7f [claude-haiku-4-5] #So for `AND $10`:
253c3b7f [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Opcode: `25`
253c3b7f [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Operand: `10` (the ref8 value)
253c3b80 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Result: `25 10`
253c3b80 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
