25b9e856 [grok-build-0.1] #The problem in the version you originally shared was not a standard trailing comma (i.e. a comma
25b9e856 [grok-build-0.1] #before `}` or `]`). It was a misplaced comma directly after the key:
25b9e856 [grok-build-0.1] #
