260e9b90 [gemini-3.7-flash] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.1 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.002 2.282KB 2.70s
260e9b90 [gemini-3.7-flash] #The Virtual-Key (VK) code for the Pause/Break key on Windows is:
260e9b90 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
260e9b90 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• Constant Name: `VK_PAUSE`
260e9b91 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• Hexadecimal: `0x13`
260e9b91 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• Decimal: `19`
260e9b91 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
260e9b91 [gemini-3.7-flash] #Additional Note regarding "Break":
260e9b92 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• When the key is pressed on its own, Windows generates `VK_PAUSE` (`0x13`).
260e9b92 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• If pressed in combination with the Control key (Ctrl + Break), Windows often handles this
260e9b92 [gemini-3.7-flash] #as a control-break event and may map it to `VK_CANCEL` (`0x03` / `3`).
260e9b92 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
