260eb947 [gemini-3.7-flash] #present:
260eb947 [gemini-3.7-flash] #- `0xa0` is at row 4, position 2 (`0xBA, 0xa0, 0x58...`)
260eb948 [gemini-3.7-flash] #- `0xA1` is at row 5, position 7 (`...0xBE, 0xA1, 0xBA`)
260eb948 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
