260eb94c [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * In your array, row 4 starts with `0xBA, 0xa0, 0x58...` (which lists Left Shift next to `X`,
260eb94d [gemini-3.7-flash] #`V`, `N`).
260eb94d [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * Row 5 starts with `0x20, 0x5A...` (Space, `Z`, `C`, `B`, `M`).
260eb94d [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * On hardware, Left Shift is in the row with `Z`, and Space/Right Shift share the row with `X`.
260eb94d [gemini-3.7-flash] #
