260f8408 [gemini-3.7-flash] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.1 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.006 13.97KB 3.13s
260f8408 [gemini-3.7-flash] #In the Motorola 6800, the Condition Code Register (CCR) is an 8-bit register where the upper two
260f8408 [gemini-3.7-flash] #bits are permanently set to `1`.
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #The bit layout from most significant bit (Bit 7) to least significant bit (Bit 0) is as follows:
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #╭─────────┬──────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  Bit    │  Symbol  │  Name            │  Description                                                                             │
260f8409 [gemini-3.7-flash] #├─────────┼──────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
260f840a [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  :---   │  :---:   │  :---            │  :---                                                                                    │
260f840a [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **7**  │  `1`     │  —               │  Permanently set to logic `1`                                                            │
260f840a [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **6**  │  `1`     │  —               │  Permanently set to logic `1`                                                            │
260f840a [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **5**  │  **H**   │  Half-Carry      │  Set if a carry occurred from bit 3 to bit 4 during an addition (used for BCD / `DAA`).  │
260f840b [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **4**  │  **I**   │  Interrupt Mask  │  When set (`1`), maskable interrupts (`IRQ`) are disabled.                               │
260f840b [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **3**  │  **N**   │  Negative        │  Set if the most significant bit (bit 7) of the result is `1`.                           │
260f840b [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **2**  │  **Z**   │  Zero            │  Set if the result of an operation is equal to `0`.                                      │
260f840c [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **1**  │  **V**   │  Overflow        │  Set if a two's complement arithmetic overflow occurs.                                   │
260f840c [gemini-3.7-flash] #│  **0**  │  **C**   │  Carry / Borrow  │  Set if a carry or borrow occurred out of bit 7 during an arithmetic operation.          │
260f840c [gemini-3.7-flash] #╰─────────┴──────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
260f840c [gemini-3.7-flash] #
260f840d [gemini-3.7-flash] #Bitmask Representation
260f840d [gemini-3.7-flash] #• H (Bit 5): `0x20`
260f840d [gemini-3.7-flash] #• I (Bit 4): `0x10`
260f840d [gemini-3.7-flash] #• N (Bit 3): `0x08`
260f840e [gemini-3.7-flash] #• Z (Bit 2): `0x04`
260f840e [gemini-3.7-flash] #• V (Bit 1): `0x02`
260f840e [gemini-3.7-flash] #• C (Bit 0): `0x01`
260f840e [gemini-3.7-flash] #
