263c2ad0 [glm-5.3] #- `displayApple1()` still references the undefined `frame` — dead code, but a trap if ever revived.
263c2ad0 [glm-5.3] #- `$AF` remains commented out, which I'd consider the right interim state.
263c2ad1 [glm-5.3] #
263c2ad1 [glm-5.3] #With the branch logic sound, the core 6502 is in good shape for the PET workload. The next
263c2ad1 [glm-5.3] #observable milestone would be whether `readPetMatrix()` ever returns real key bits to break the
263c2ad1 [glm-5.3] #`E297` wait on `020D` — happy to look at the terminal FFI side whenever you're ready to share it.
