264e707a [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264e707b [gemini-3.7-flash] #For a standard Commodore Plus/4 emulator:
264e707b [gemini-3.7-flash] #• Writes to `FD20–FD2F` should be treated as a no-op (ignored).
