264f3b0b [gemini-3.7-flash] #Here is a step-by-step summary of the boot sequence captured in your trace:
264f3b0b [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b0b [gemini-3.7-flash] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
264f3b0c [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b0c [gemini-3.7-flash] #Phase 1: Reset & Basic CPU Initialization (`FFF6` – `F2A9`)
264f3b0c [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `FFF6`: Reads the hardware reset vector and writes to `FF3E`, which configures
264f3b0c [gemini-3.7-flash] #the memory map to map the ROMs into the upper address space.
264f3b0c [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `FFF9` / `F2A4`: Jumps to the hardware initialization sequence:
264f3b0d [gemini-3.7-flash] #  * Initializes the stack pointer (`TXS` with `#$FF`).
264f3b0d [gemini-3.7-flash] #  * Disables interrupts (`SEI`).
264f3b0d [gemini-3.7-flash] #  * Clears the decimal arithmetic flag (`CLD`).
264f3b0d [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `F2A9`: Calls subroutine `CFA6`.
264f3b0e [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b0e [gemini-3.7-flash] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
264f3b0e [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b0f [gemini-3.7-flash] #Phase 2: Speech Hardware Initialization (`CFA6` – `CFB0`)
264f3b0f [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `CFA6` – `CFAD`: Writes `09` followed by `89` to `$FD20`.
264f3b0f [gemini-3.7-flash] #  * This is an initialization strobe intended for the Toshiba T6721A voice synthesizer chip
264f3b0f [gemini-3.7-flash] #(present in the Commodore V364 prototype). On a stock Plus/4, this write goes to open bus.
264f3b10 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `CFB0`: Jumps directly to `FC1E` to begin scanning for Function ROMs and
264f3b10 [gemini-3.7-flash] #cartridges.
264f3b10 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b10 [gemini-3.7-flash] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
264f3b11 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b11 [gemini-3.7-flash] #Phase 3: Function ROM / Cartridge Header Scan (`FC1E` – `FC33`)
264f3b11 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b11 [gemini-3.7-flash] #1. Clear Identification Table (`FC1E` – `FC28`):
264f3b12 [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * Initializes a 4-byte table in zero page/RAM (`05EC–05EF`) to `$00` using a descending loop
264f3b12 [gemini-3.7-flash] #indexed by the `X` register (`3` down to `0`).
264f3b12 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264f3b13 [gemini-3.7-flash] #2. Bank Selection & ROM Signature Check (`FC2A` – `FC3B`):
264f3b13 [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * Tracks the bank index (`3` down to `0`) in zero-page location `$96`.
264f3b13 [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * `FC2C` – `FC30`: Looks up the hardware strobe offset from a table at `FC7B` and writes
264f3b13 [gemini-3.7-flash] #to the banking register region (`FDD0,X` → `FDDF` for bank 3) to switch the active ROM bank
264f3b14 [gemini-3.7-flash] #at `8000`.
264f3b14 [gemini-3.7-flash] #   * `FC33` – `FC3E`: Checks for the cartridge signature string `"CBM"` (`43`, `42`, `4D`)
264f3b14 [gemini-3.7-flash] #at memory locations `8007–8009` by comparing them against the expected values at
