264f9294 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• The loop will terminate when `96` drops below `0` (`BPL FC2A` will not branch).
264f9294 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• The KERNAL will leave Bank 0 selected (mapping the standard BASIC ROM into `8000–BFFF`)
264f9294 [gemini-3.7-flash] #and proceed directly to zero-page initialization, RAM size detection, and the standard Commodore
264f9295 [gemini-3.7-flash] #BASIC startup screen.
