264fa40d [gemini-3.7-flash] #Breakdown of True Ranges
264fa40d [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264fa40d [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `0xFD00` – `0xFDDF`: ACIA (`FD00`), SPI User Port (`FD10`), Expansion/Speech (`FD20`),
264fa40d [gemini-3.7-flash] #and Banking latches (`FDD0–$FDDF`).
264fa40e [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `0xFF00` – `0xFF3F`: Primary TED registers (`FF00–FF1F`), Register mirrors (`FF20–FF3D`),
264fa40e [gemini-3.7-flash] #and ROM/RAM configuration strobes (`FF3E–FF3F`).
264fa40e [gemini-3.7-flash] #
264fa40f [gemini-3.7-flash] #All other addresses in the `F000–FFFF` block (namely `F000–FCFF`, `FDE0–FEFF`, and `FF40–FFFF`) map
264fa40f [gemini-3.7-flash] #to RAM during write cycles.
264fa40f [gemini-3.7-flash] #
