26d2ec7e [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #
26d2ec7e [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #What is ANSI mode 2027?
26d2ec7f [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #
26d2ec7f [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #Mode 2027 is a DEC private mode (like 1006 for mouse, 1004 for focus events) that controls
26d2ec7f [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #grapheme cluster handling in terminals. When enabled, the terminal treats each Unicode
26d2ec7f [deepseek-v4-flash-vision] #grapheme cluster (e.g., `👨‍👩‍👧‍👦`, `é` = `e` + combining acute, `🇺🇸` = regional indicators)
