2702d925 [glm-5.3-flash] #The rest of the main-loop layout is hardcoded pixels: the ROM pin indicators start at x=104 with
2702d925 [glm-5.3-flash] #24px pitch (needs ~292px width), and the line spiral is centered at (250, 125) with an 80px radius
2702d926 [glm-5.3-flash] #— that reaches x=330, so the current panel is at least 320 wide. A smaller panel will need those
