2702d927 [glm-5.3-flash] #with a byte swap (`(rgb>>8)|((rgb&0xff)<<8)`), which assumes the panel takes big-endian 16-bit
2702d927 [glm-5.3-flash] #color. If the downgrade changes colour format (e.g. an SSD1306 OLED is mono 1bpp), this whole path
2702d927 [glm-5.3-flash] #changes.
