270ec259 [gemini-3.7-flash] #diagnostics logic (`extends Node`) and the 3D spinning cube logic (`extends Node3D`) must reside in
270ec259 [gemini-3.7-flash] #separate `.gd` files attached to their respective nodes in the scene tree.
